01:19:25.098 --> 01:19:26.261
You should try it some time.


01:19:27.606 --> 01:19:31.570
Unless, unless you have something else 
you'd like to say.. to me.


01:19:34.085 --> 01:19:34.813
Wally


01:19:37.055 --> 01:19:38.649
Really? Got nothing for me, huh?


01:19:42.498 --> 01:19:43.966
That's not...


01:19:44.672 --> 01:19:47.368
Hey, Wally, thanks for being on lice patrol, man!


01:19:48.880 --> 01:19:50.539
You gotta try some of this beer grandma made!


01:21:06.096 --> 01:21:07.865
Sebastian, what happened?


01:21:07.900 --> 01:21:09.494
I was at Tony's birthday party and


01:21:10.473 --> 01:21:11.303
did what you told me to.


01:21:11.608 --> 01:21:13.636
And O'Connor was there.


01:21:14.282 --> 01:21:16.581
I stood up to him and acted crazy.


01:21:22.430 --> 01:21:23.398
You're face..


01:21:23.966 --> 01:21:26.804
He punched me, and then throw me into a puddle.


01:21:27.773 --> 01:21:28.673
and then hit me again.


01:21:31.580 --> 01:21:33.448
He didn't care that I was crazy.


01:21:35.019 --> 01:21:36.614
It didn't worked, I've tried.


01:21:38.360 --> 01:21:41.629
Where was this? Where was the party?
- At the park.


01:21:41.967 --> 01:21:44.633
- Which park?
- East-End.


01:21:45.574 --> 01:21:46.639
East-End Park?


01:21:46.674 --> 01:21:50.116
That's like 20 blocks away from here.


01:21:51.852 --> 01:21:53.458
- I gotta call your mom come fetch ya.
- No!


01:21:53.493 --> 01:21:56.021
Wally you have to take me home.


01:21:59.667 --> 01:22:00.896
Take me home, Wally.


01:22:03.142 --> 01:22:05.978
Sebastian, why did you come here?


01:22:07.719 --> 01:22:09.711
Because I thought you would be proud of me.


01:22:19.007 --> 01:22:22.864
Oh my God, what happened to you?
- I got into a fight.


01:22:22.899 --> 01:22:26.686
Sweaty, oh my God. What? What? 
Why did't Dany call me?


01:22:26.721 --> 01:22:31.095
It's actully my fault. I told him to do somethings.. really stupid a while back, and he listened to me.


01:22:31.130 --> 01:22:35.936
He's fine. He came over to my place, and..
- He came to you?


01:22:37.441 --> 01:22:38.467
Yeah. And..


01:22:40.417 --> 01:22:44.550
Oh. What's going on? - Rolands family is in town.
We're just having a little brunch.


01:22:44.925 --> 01:22:45.981
Hey Wally! - Who beat the kid?


01:22:47.897 --> 01:22:51.530
C'mon sweaty here. Oh my God. You're covered in dirt.
- C'mon honey.


01:22:52.975 --> 01:22:53.874
Let's go and clean..


01:23:02.426 --> 01:23:04.419
Hey Wally! What happened?


01:23:04.764 --> 01:23:07.466
He got in a fight with another kid. 
- Ah, that's awful.


01:23:07.501 --> 01:23:11.307
You know, but it will make him stronger.
Took a few lungs when I was kid.


01:23:12.244 --> 01:23:15.275
Usually at the hands of my old brothers.
They're all here, you gotta meet them.


01:23:15.618 --> 01:23:17.211
Oh, wait. Hold on!


01:23:20.929 --> 01:23:21.657
Check it out.


01:23:27.172 --> 01:23:29.735
Stick around! It's gonna get good.


01:23:33.454 --> 01:23:34.353
I'm sorry Roland.


01:23:38.662 --> 01:23:39.459
For what?


01:23:40.132 --> 01:23:42.032
Doesn't feel that bad, huh?


01:23:43.204 --> 01:23:45.734
I really do need to talk to you.


01:23:46.879 --> 01:23:50.821
Act crazy, Wally? Remember me never to ask you 
for advice when I'm being bullied.


01:23:50.856 --> 01:23:52.856
What do you want me Debbie? I'm an idiot. Right.


01:23:52.891 --> 01:23:54.257
Kassie, this can not wait!


01:23:55.297 --> 01:23:58.633
I got it.
I'll be right back.


01:24:04.612 --> 01:24:06.084
What got into him?


01:24:07.553 --> 01:24:09.353
Want to try these beans?


01:24:09.960 --> 01:24:11.858
Alright Wally, what is it?


01:24:14.333 --> 01:24:17.364
There she is!
Hey Kass, Wally, c'mon in!


01:24:17.675 --> 01:24:18.935
Yeah, c'mon in, take a seat.


01:24:20.078 --> 01:24:21.706
Listen.. Hang on.. One sec..
- I can't.. - Kass!


01:24:22.015 --> 01:24:23.950
You too Wally!


01:24:25.455 --> 01:24:26.351
C'mon take a seat.


01:24:27.391 --> 01:24:28.690
Everybody listen up!


01:24:29.831 --> 01:24:30.820
Hush! Hush!


01:24:32.368 --> 01:24:33.837
I've got something to say, everybody!


01:24:38.179 --> 01:24:39.011
A few months ago.


01:24:40.183 --> 01:24:43.954
I'm not gonna lie. I was ehm..
I was in a dark place.


01:24:46.296 --> 01:24:47.525
I was in a world of pain.


01:24:48.601 --> 01:24:49.699
Kassie, I rally have to talk to you.


01:24:49.734 --> 01:24:56.991
My wife.. ex-wife had left me for reasons 
I don't need to.. I don't need to get into.


01:24:57.083 --> 01:24:58.849
Over here! Right now!


01:24:59.287 --> 01:25:02.819
Talk to me now! Trust me, this is really important!


01:25:03.364 --> 01:25:11.201
And one day, the heavens send me 
a sweat voice of an angel on my phone machine.


01:25:11.236 --> 01:25:12.524
And I'm happy to say


01:25:12.559 --> 01:25:14.351
to you all,


01:25:14.485 --> 01:25:15.818
that I love..


01:25:16.957 --> 01:25:19.825
That my life is whole again.


01:25:19.860 --> 01:25:22.564
Today Sebastian scared the hell out of me.


01:25:22.599 --> 01:25:24.592
Wally, take a seat, I'm about to get 
to the good stuff.


01:25:24.902 --> 01:25:27.775
Roland, I'm about.. I'm sorry. I know you're a 
really good guy. I hate to do this to you.


01:25:28.245 --> 01:25:30.042
Hate to do what?
Throw this curve ball.


01:25:30.917 --> 01:25:34.355
When Sebastian needed someone today,
Kassie, he came to me.


01:25:34.859 --> 01:25:37.588
He needed me. And, and...


01:25:38.098 --> 01:25:39.030
And I need him.


01:25:39.734 --> 01:25:41.703
Wha.. What are you talking about, Wally?


01:25:41.738 --> 01:25:45.303
I'm talking about something I
haven't been able to say before, Kassie.


01:25:47.950 --> 01:25:52.416
I... I hijacked your pregnancy.


01:25:54.698 --> 01:25:56.393
I am the seed guy.


01:26:02.677 --> 01:26:03.612
What?


01:26:04.916 --> 01:26:08.219
I replaced eh.. Roland's offering


01:26:09.258 --> 01:26:11.924
with mine. That night, your party.


01:26:16.673 --> 01:26:18.470
Sebastian's my son.


01:26:20.279 --> 01:26:23.077
I know it was reckless, careless


01:26:23.687 --> 01:26:26.460
and terrible thing to do. I panicked.


01:26:26.793 --> 01:26:28.764
I'm not like you, you know.


01:26:29.398 --> 01:26:32.868
You're not afraid of anything. 
I'm afraid of everything.


01:26:32.903 --> 01:26:36.711
I can't even take risks. You know, you said it.
But nothing scares you Kassie. 
And I love that about you.


01:26:38.984 --> 01:26:41.250
I mean you're gonna hate me for 
the rest of your life.


01:26:41.655 --> 01:26:44.283
And you're never gonna forgive me,
and I don't expect you to forgive me.


01:26:44.962 --> 01:26:48.730
It just, it breaks my heart, it kills me, because


01:26:49.604 --> 01:26:51.039
You've changed me.


01:26:52.476 --> 01:26:53.273
You've changed me.


01:26:54.012 --> 01:26:54.947
And ehm..


01:26:59.092 --> 01:26:59.853
I love you.


01:27:08.874 --> 01:27:10.846
I could not say that before
but I'm saying it right now.


01:27:17.859 --> 01:27:19.293
And I'm also saying that I'm sorry.


01:27:20.732 --> 01:27:21.629
Really sorry.


01:27:29.414 --> 01:27:31.351
Luckily, we got that dirty off.


01:27:35.427 --> 01:27:36.623
Don't ever speak to us again.


01:27:45.115 --> 01:27:46.013
What did I miss?


01:27:54.800 --> 01:27:56.163
Sorry about your proposal, Roland.


01:27:57.706 --> 01:27:58.604
His what?


01:28:01.178 --> 01:28:02.339
Oh my God!


01:28:14.136 --> 01:28:15.069
I'm proud of you.


01:28:56.286 --> 01:28:59.053
Wally, it's 4 a:m.


01:28:59.726 --> 01:29:02.163
I did it. I did the right thing, Leonard.


01:29:03.168 --> 01:29:05.502
- C'mon in!
- Faced my fear. I told her.


01:29:06.572 --> 01:29:08.667
- That's good.
- Wally, that's real, real good.


01:29:09.111 --> 01:29:10.909
I lost her.


01:29:11.781 --> 01:29:12.806
And Sebastian.


01:29:15.925 --> 01:29:17.895
You did the right thing.
I'm proud of you, Wally.


01:29:19.164 --> 01:29:21.396
It sucks.
- It'll are get better.


01:29:21.869 --> 01:29:25.329
I drink booze from a deli.


01:29:29.217 --> 01:29:30.414
You should go home, Wally.


01:29:33.894 --> 01:29:35.257
They are my home, Leonard


01:31:19.166 --> 01:31:21.968
So I've thought about it.


01:31:23.274 --> 01:31:24.172
And ehm..


01:31:25.446 --> 01:31:28.244
You can't just disappear from Sebastians life.


01:31:29.652 --> 01:31:30.515
So..


01:31:31.356 --> 01:31:32.586
He's your son.


01:31:35.263 --> 01:31:37.394
And of course you can see him but


01:31:39.070 --> 01:31:40.563
it's gonna be on my terms.


01:31:45.251 --> 01:31:46.220
How's it goin?


01:31:48.556 --> 01:31:49.523
He misses you.


01:31:50.262 --> 01:31:52.527
I miss him.
- A lot.


01:31:53.801 --> 01:31:55.702
And how's he getting along with Roland?
Ok?


01:31:58.142 --> 01:31:59.109
Well..


01:32:02.783 --> 01:32:04.184
I couldn't live through with that.


01:32:07.827 --> 01:32:09.798
- What happened? What do you mean?
- I don't know


01:32:13.639 --> 01:32:17.601
He is affectionate, likes me to try new things.


01:32:19.185 --> 01:32:21.154
He doesn't turn into a psycho when he drinks.


01:32:21.856 --> 01:32:24.256
He doesn't moan when he eats.


01:32:28.102 --> 01:32:30.038
I turned him down,
because he's not you.


01:32:48.341 --> 01:32:52.282
Will you marry me?
- Probably.


01:33:16.630 --> 01:33:17.325
Look at.


01:33:19.569 --> 01:33:22.064
Running around.
Always rushed.


01:33:23.577 --> 01:33:24.337
Always late.


01:33:25.912 --> 01:33:27.644
Guess that's why they called it the human race.


01:33:31.124 --> 01:33:33.360
But sometimes, it slows down just enogh for


01:33:33.395 --> 01:33:35.629
all the pieces fall into place


01:33:39.644 --> 01:33:40.769
Fate works it's magic.


01:33:44.585 --> 01:33:45.575
And you're connected.


01:33:49.793 --> 01:33:50.694
Hi.
- Do you smell that?


01:33:50.729 --> 01:33:56.305
What is that? 
- It's dry coal, lightable fluid, 
and my burned arm. Give me a kiss before you go?


01:33:57.909 --> 01:33:59.775
Shame with all these children around.


01:34:00.315 --> 01:34:01.806
I don't mind an audience.
- Don't?


01:34:03.187 --> 01:34:04.656
Oh God, no, Honey, here! Ice cream.


01:34:04.957 --> 01:34:08.298
Take this out there. But be careful. 
One of these children has a milk allergy and


01:34:08.333 --> 01:34:10.134
I have no clue which one it is.


01:34:10.169 --> 01:34:12.733
It might be the little blonde one over there.
- Wanna just do it like a sorbet?


01:34:13.006 --> 01:34:14.670
No! - You sure?
- No.


01:34:53.918 --> 01:34:55.046
How bout that?


01:34:55.521 --> 01:35:00.125
Now this year, Sebastian has decided
to dedicate his birthday to Doug.


01:35:00.602 --> 01:35:05.338
And Doug is eh.. just a wonderful,
playful, three-legged dog.


01:35:06.913 --> 01:35:09.212
He's in need of a home.


01:35:09.515 --> 01:35:11.050
So


01:35:11.085 --> 01:35:12.586
And?


01:35:14.495 --> 01:35:15.519
And ehm..


01:35:16.830 --> 01:35:21.135
Well Doug is ehm, he's next in line 
at the kill shelter to be kicked out.


01:35:21.574 --> 01:35:23.168
Oh no, it would be a horrible way to go.


01:35:24.714 --> 01:35:28.198
But not dead yet, not dead yet. 
- That's just so good. I was just thinking 
- A very, very much alive and happy puppy.


01:35:28.696 --> 01:35:32.028
Let's go ahead. Let's blow out the candles. 
Let's get some of that cake in our face.


01:35:32.063 --> 01:35:35.126
I'm not blowing out anything until 
someone takes Doug.


01:35:39.274 --> 01:35:40.107
Well I take him!


01:35:40.979 --> 01:35:43.677
"C'est l'esprit"!
"C'est l'esprit"!


01:35:45.186 --> 01:35:47.418
He only got 3 legs.


01:35:51.699 --> 01:35:52.632
Alright baby c'mon.


01:35:57.445 --> 01:35:58.140
One more!


01:36:00.550 --> 01:36:01.382
Happy birthday!


01:36:04.391 --> 01:36:06.588
Everyonce in a while in all the randomness


01:36:08.432 --> 01:36:11.634
Something unexpected happenes, 
and it pushes us all forward.


01:36:13.274 --> 01:36:14.265
And the tuth is..


01:36:15.111 --> 01:36:17.013
What I'm starting to think..


01:36:17.983 --> 01:36:19.886
What I'm starting to feel..


01:36:22.728 --> 01:36:25.424
Is that maybe, the human race..


01:36:27.503 --> 01:36:29.234
Isn't a race at all.

